<item>
<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>New:&lt;br&gt;• Gift previews show your message in a bubble that resizes as you type, with animated stars on the View button.&lt;br&gt;• Switching between light and dark themes dissolves the old look into drifting specks.&lt;br&gt;• Appearance has a Font setting: System, Rounded, Serif, Monospaced, Helvetica Neue or Avenir Next.&lt;br&gt;• With the Dictator theme, a Monochrome switch in Appearance turns emoji, stickers, avatars, reactions, photos, GIFs, videos and gift and profile backgrounds black and white; the media viewer keeps the original colors.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Gift previews are easier to read in dark mode, and Stars prices are clearer in the gift catalog.&lt;br&gt;• Appearance settings use Liquid Glass tabs that scroll smoothly when browsing gifts.&lt;br&gt;</description>
