<description>Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Bring Liquid Glass gift cards to Buy a Gift, the marketplace, Gift Crafting, QR Studio, and Wallet&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• Keep the music pill and cover pattern from jumping when leaving profile editing&lt;br&gt;• Match voice, file, and other profile tab controls to the profile colors&lt;br&gt;• Keep gift shadows from clipping at the edges of the profile grid&lt;br&gt;</description>
