<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>Improved:&lt;br&gt;• Refined the animation when editing member tags.&lt;br&gt;• Updated playback for group calls and live stories.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• Chat bubbles no longer jump when several translations arrive together.&lt;br&gt;• Profile music starts with the track shown on the profile.&lt;br&gt;• Member tag previews keep the sender name and timestamp inside the message bubble.&lt;br&gt;</description>
