<item>
<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>New:&lt;br&gt;• The AI agent can check giveaways, Premium gift codes and Fragment collectibles, show who signed a channel post, and give a short security checkup of your account (two-step verification, recovery email, devices, privacy)&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improved:&lt;br&gt;• The AI agent pages through more search results and keeps blocked people and hidden chats out of member lists and statistics&lt;br&gt;• Image decoding uses less memory: a photo's decoded copy and file bytes are released once it is on screen, and wide-colour wallpapers take half the memory&lt;br&gt;</description>
