<item>
<title>Telegram macOS</title>
<description>New:&lt;br&gt;• Add a message to an on-chain gift when buying it for someone else.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Improved:&lt;br&gt;• See offer, listing, and unlisting fees before confirming in Wallet.&lt;br&gt;• See decoded details when signing a supported TON contract message in Wallet.&lt;br&gt;• Refine the glass styling of the emoji, sticker, and reaction pickers.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Fixed:&lt;br&gt;• Completed on-chain offers show a reply linking to the original offer.&lt;br&gt;• Unlisted gifts update immediately in open profiles, and listed Wallet gifts can be worn from your profile.&lt;br&gt;</description>
